    <briefdescription>
<para>Priority-inheriting mutual exclusion primitive for tasks and protothreads. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides recursive mutual exclusion with priority inheritance to prevent unbounded priority inversion. If a higher-priority task attempts to acquire a mutex held by a lower-priority task, the owner&apos;s priority is temporarily boosted to match the waiting task until the mutex is released. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
